<title>UK: UK meals/feeds end unchanged, tradeless.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds end unchanged, tradeless.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK meals and feeds market closed unchanged to firmer and, on lack of buying interest, once again tradeless.</p>
<p>Soybean meal selling levels advanced one to four sterling per tonne in line with overseas gains on Friday but opening indications on Chicago's soybean oil futures, point towards the likelihood of lower levels in the UK on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Rapemeal values were left completely unchanged.</p>
<p>--Stephen Grainger +44 171 542 8074</p>
